  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under ITIL 4 Section 5.2 (Configuration Management), a CMDB maintains a comprehensive inventory of IT assets (configuration items), their attributes, and the relationships between them. This supports change management, incident management, and impact analysis before changes are implemented.
